  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Imposing Mausoleum</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Unsettling Casting</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you succeed on a concentration check as part of creating a magic sphere effect, any strain damage you take from spending spell points on that effect is reduced by 1 (minimum 0). Whenever you would risk a wild magic effect from creating a magic sphere effect, you may attempt a concentration check (DC 15 + 1/2 the caster level) to reduce the wild magic chance by 25% + 5% for every 5 by which you beat the concentration check DC.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wild-magic-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
